                                                "sense_id": "dece8e71-4b68-39d1-9467-1df1569028c2",
                                                "text": "Trimates are trisexuals from the planet Tiberon, visiting earth in their flying saucers. Each union consists of a Polar, who always tells the truth; a Polee who always lies; and a Nexus, who makes statements that are […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
