                                                "sense_id": "677f55c0-096c-332d-98fc-559a1f99d17c",
                                                "text": "\"I was told he's trisexual.\" \"Quit it!\" Alice laughed. \"There's no such thing as trisexual.\" \"I guess you don't read the new books, dearie. That's someone who'll try anything.\" Alice held her nose."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7d8b8ff-6f7b-4b43-a310-c8e3d1af4a6d",
                                                "sense_id": "677f55c0-096c-332d-98fc-559a1f99d17c",
                                                "text": "\"Yes, and she's trisexual.\" \"Trisexual? What does that mean?\" \"She'll try anything!\""
                                            }
                                        ]
